{{page-title "SKY-Flex | CleanTech"}}

<article class="page margin-page">
  <div class="container-app">
    <section
      class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/90 p-10 shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/10 backdrop-blur"
    >
      <p class="coming-soon-badge">{{this.locale.t "dropdown.comingSoon"}}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900">SKY-Flex</h1>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        {{#if this.locale.isKorean}}
          SKY-Flex 자료와 시공 사례를 준비 중입니다. 곧 업데이트될 예정이며,
          문의가 필요하시면 아래 연락처로 알려주세요.
        {{else}}
          SKY-Flex product information and project references are being prepared
          and will be published soon. In the meantime, feel free to reach us
          through the links below.
        {{/if}}
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <LinkTo @route="contact" class="btn">{{this.locale.t
            "nav.contact"
          }}</LinkTo>
        <LinkTo @route="downloads" class="btn-ghost">{{this.locale.t
            "footer.downloads.title"
          }}</LinkTo>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>